# Installer runtime dependencies, declared rather than inherited transitively.
#   locales              localecfg runs locale-gen for the chosen locale and is
#                        fatal on failure.
#   keyboard-configuration
#                        provides the console keymap handling that reads
#                        /etc/default/keyboard, which the keyboard module writes.
#   initramfs-tools      the initramfs module runs update-initramfs to give an
#                        encrypted install an image that can unlock its root.
locales
keyboard-configuration
initramfs-tools
